<HelloFraandsPage updated="2026-10-19" title="Influencer requirements" summary="Influencer banne se pehle yeh zaroori shartein padhein." review={true} related={[{ href: '/hosts/rules', label: 'Influencer rules' }, { href: '/hosts/agreement', label: 'Influencer agreement' }]}>
<h2>Who can join as an influencer?</h2><ul><li>You must be at least 18 and an Indian resident.</li><li>Use your own phone number and one account per person.</li><li>Only you may take calls on your account. Do not share or rent it.</li><li>You need 10 or more followers on the channel you connect. Connect YouTube by signing in with it, or Instagram with a short code in your bio.</li><li>Joining needs no ID check. We check your ID (KYC) and your UPI once, before your first payout.</li></ul>
<h2>Conversation, without professional claims</h2><p>Do not present yourself on {BRAND.name} as a doctor, lawyer, counsellor, chartered accountant or financial advisor. Do not give medical, legal, financial or other regulated advice, even if you hold a qualification outside the platform.</p>
<p>Give honest profile details. Keep your account details up to date.</p>
</HelloFraandsPage>
